    "causal_summary": "Wave 4 of the over-engineering removal program: delete the one-time fleet-enablement stack (F3) — enable-modes.cjs plus lib/fleet-enablement/ — and its two tests. It drove modes from legacy to new_authoritative_final; all 8 modes are already there, so it has zero operational callers. F4 (flip-authority.cjs) was resequenced into phase 005 because it shares the authority-finalize.vitest.ts test file with the phase-005 CAS mutators, so the two remove together as one whole-file test deletion.",
